{"crossReviewDisposition": "missed-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "فعّل مزامنة الألبومات المطلوبة في Lidarr وإعدادات استيراد التنزيلات المكتملة. وتظل المزامنة المباشرة تعمل فقط عبر إجراءات Lidarr الصريحة أو المهام المجدولة المُهيأة.", "finalValueSha256": "48dabbd8cb9d534f8579246e85926308ebbd104e1e77307ed7e37a73ddbd80c6", "locale": "ar", "previousValue": "تمكين مزامنة الألبوم المطلوب Lidarr وإعدادات استيراد التنزيل المكتمل. لا تزال المزامنة المباشرة تعمل فقط من خلال إجراءات Lidarr الصريحة أو برامج الجدولة التي تم تكوينها.", "previousValueSha256": "5829777a50108e1a79583ba392bc72e2122f9ebb4c884558361235bbdbde746d", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/ar.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "confirm-primary-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Activa la sincronización de álbumes deseados de Lidarr y la importación de descargas completadas. La sincronización en vivo sigue ejecutándose solo mediante acciones explícitas de Lidarr o tareas programadas configuradas.", "finalValueSha256": "74b42bca6367036bc932e275fccf9877a381ac21c69d827ca42c52a843bd0b96", "locale": "es", "previousValue": "Habilite la sincronización del álbum deseado Lidarr y la configuración de importación de descarga completa. La sincronización en vivo aún se ejecuta solo desde acciones Lidarr explícitas o programadores configurados.", "previousValueSha256": "cf419c7be8ce2bc002d4d55c125b98ecd0f57569384e58142ab55e8626f124cc", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/es.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "missed-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Activez la synchronisation des albums recherchés dans Lidarr et l’importation des téléchargements terminés. La synchronisation en direct ne se déclenche toujours qu’à partir d’actions explicites de Lidarr ou de tâches planifiées configurées.", "finalValueSha256": "7c0881af4b4c6f0843f126390b5eff36ede8d50555ddd1bd5a884ae305a715e8", "locale": "fr", "previousValue": "Activez les paramètres de synchronisation des albums recherchés Lidarr et d'importation des téléchargements terminés. La synchronisation en direct s'exécute toujours uniquement à partir d'actions Lidarr explicites ou de planificateurs configurés.", "previousValueSha256": "3007356c5b4a230dbb3fa2ae83ce9b664f07737dc39bf413a75436977e4500c9", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/fr.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "missed-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Lidarr में वांछित एल्बमों का सिंक और पूरे हो चुके डाउनलोड के आयात की सेटिंग सक्षम करें। लाइव सिंक अब भी केवल स्पष्ट Lidarr कार्रवाइयों या कॉन्फ़िगर किए गए शेड्यूलर से चलता है।", "finalValueSha256": "70c06d28248d85b5b6b0ad47a79c22e68308e7184d297902bd2d70cdae73d406", "locale": "hi", "previousValue": "Lidarr वांछित-एल्बम सिंक और पूर्ण-डाउनलोड आयात सेटिंग्स सक्षम करें। लाइव सिंक अभी भी केवल स्पष्ट Lidarr क्रियाओं या कॉन्फ़िगर किए गए शेड्यूलर से चलता है।", "previousValueSha256": "bc086cfa74169ec9b6989d75ec555ee15e2be01fa47c2a7727d5a5e0ce570d56", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/hi.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "confirm-primary-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Aktifkan sinkronisasi album yang diinginkan di Lidarr dan pengaturan impor unduhan yang telah selesai. Sinkronisasi langsung tetap berjalan hanya melalui tindakan Lidarr yang eksplisit atau penjadwal yang dikonfigurasi.", "finalValueSha256": "8610dfca51de45393fda5cdaddbdecddafd32c8549629988777d5f859f713cbf", "locale": "id", "previousValue": "Aktifkan sinkronisasi album yang diinginkan Lidarr dan pengaturan impor unduhan selesai. Sinkronisasi langsung masih berjalan hanya dari tindakan Lidarr eksplisit atau penjadwal yang dikonfigurasi.", "previousValueSha256": "b7b497f39bb56b851f94a96a97dca2d8573881d64e22a15723022741902f2af7", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/id.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "confirm-primary-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Lidarrで取得対象にしたアルバムの同期と、完了したダウンロードのインポート設定を有効にします。リアルタイム同期は引き続き、明示的なLidarr操作または設定済みスケジューラーからのみ実行されます。", "finalValueSha256": "903d45332e1cb439365adef6d19e1237890ca7bf725e2e36080d80a2245620c5", "locale": "ja", "previousValue": "Lidarr 希望アルバムの同期とダウンロード完了インポート設定を有効にします。ライブ同期は引き続き、明示的な Lidarr アクションまたは構成されたスケジューラーからのみ実行されます。", "previousValueSha256": "536e5bc94851d55cafc9380fc930f4bbdbce099f76911b29dbbd109298c119aa", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/ja.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "missed-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Lidarr의 원하는 앨범 동기화와 완료된 다운로드 가져오기 설정을 활성화합니다. 실시간 동기화는 여전히 명시적인 Lidarr 작업 또는 구성된 스케줄러에서만 실행됩니다.", "finalValueSha256": "56a360c8fd64c719439b32d6730798f09c10a7223b154c1a3d60deedaf7512e3", "locale": "ko", "previousValue": "Lidarr 원하는 앨범 동기화 및 다운로드 완료 가져오기 설정을 활성화합니다. 라이브 동기화는 여전히 명시적인 Lidarr 작업 또는 구성된 스케줄러에서만 실행됩니다.", "previousValueSha256": "df1133b724ae6e10dc6b67a4517b5de489304ccbf11c968b52e72b52cc742ffb", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/ko.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "confirm-primary-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Ative a sincronização dos álbuns desejados do Lidarr e as configurações de importação de downloads concluídos. A sincronização em tempo real ainda é executada apenas por ações explícitas do Lidarr ou agendadores configurados.", "finalValueSha256": "e3b41e8d4fd8e8e991794172ad9ab62d0b3e3be8f1dcef606b429b0af9c37244", "locale": "pt-BR", "previousValue": "Ative a sincronização do álbum desejado Lidarr e as configurações de importação de download concluído. A sincronização ao vivo ainda é executada apenas a partir de ações Lidarr explícitas ou agendadores configurados.", "previousValueSha256": "0f65c406ee2890570dff348ef86f44f380bbfe3c13357363c903d00534b09255", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/pt-BR.json"}
{"crossReviewDisposition": "confirm-primary-correction", "disposition": "correction", "exactHead": "cb6739864b3651d72412b6aeb4590537cbf23d4e", "exactTree": "a0946207555e494a558707008ba051013964b447", "finalValue": "Bật đồng bộ hóa các album được đánh dấu là cần tìm trong Lidarr và cài đặt nhập các lượt tải xuống đã hoàn tất. Đồng bộ hóa theo thời gian thực vẫn chỉ chạy khi có thao tác Lidarr rõ ràng hoặc theo bộ lập lịch đã cấu hình.", "finalValueSha256": "49924ab0f158a67db44e8b109f029718e973928e726c48bfc08920b98ff8d4c9", "locale": "vi", "previousValue": "Bật cài đặt đồng bộ hóa album mong muốn Lidarr và cài đặt nhập tải xuống đã hoàn tất. Đồng bộ hóa trực tiếp vẫn chỉ chạy từ các hành động Lidarr rõ ràng hoặc bộ lập lịch đã định cấu hình.", "previousValueSha256": "d9c99c7cfda5b3a31fa958a644e30d6eacbfeb4386b29c79ade2292214b3d434", "selectionRank": 70, "source": "Enable Lidarr wanted-album sync and completed-download import settings. Live sync still runs only from explicit Lidarr actions or configured schedulers.", "sourceId": "src_11f7d87af597f80f", "sourceOrdinal": null, "sourceSha256": "11f7d87af597f80fa8cb9201e1d162ae1aa1fd05b08d72ab2b445ef613480c9f", "targetFile": "src/web/public/locales/vi.json"}
